<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Reviewed launchd service file for the global NATS hub's CURRENT host (kinu).
  Design: sim/design/kinu-nats-deployment.md, KN-2 (ruling R2). Bead aae-orc-5jpjc.

  Why KeepAlive true: nats-server exits 0 on a graceful stop (TERM and INT,
  measured on 2.14.6), and the old rule, KeepAlive SuccessfulExit=false,
  relaunches only after a nonzero exit, so a graceful stop left the hub down
  with nothing reporting it. With KeepAlive true a deliberate stop is a
  `launchctl bootout`, never a kill. A bad conf is relaunched every 10 seconds
  (the default ThrottleInterval), which is loud by design.

  This file is applied only in the approved cutover window, never before.
  Nothing here is installed or loaded by this repository.

  The program is the launcher installed on the hub host, run through bash. It
  sets the names the hub conf reads before it execs nats-server, so a plist
  that ran nats-server directly would leave the conf unreadable, and under
  KeepAlive true it would be relaunched every 10 seconds and stay down. None
  of that logic is in this repository.

  Placeholders, filled in by the cutover:
    __HUB_HOME__             the hub account's home directory (also HOME below).
    __NATS_SERVER_BIN_DIR__  the absolute directory of the pinned nats-server.
  The pinned binary comes first in PATH, so a version-manager shim directory
  is never consulted, and no version is chosen in this file (design O3). The
  cutover checks the realpath and the version before loading this file.

  No seed, password or token is set here.

  This file does not decide who supervises the hub (open question Q1); it is
  the service file for where the hub runs today.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.arcaven.nats-global</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/bin/bash</string>
		<string>__HUB_HOME__/.director/nats-global/hub-start.sh</string>
	</array>
	<key>WorkingDirectory</key>
	<string>__HUB_HOME__/.director/nats-global</string>
	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>HOME</key>
		<string>__HUB_HOME__</string>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>__NATS_SERVER_BIN_DIR__:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
	</dict>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>__HUB_HOME__/.director/nats-global/log/nats-server.log</string>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>__HUB_HOME__/.director/nats-global/log/nats-server.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
